{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34030","headline":"醉中即席赠润卿博士 · 皮日休","name":"醉中即席赠润卿博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"适越游吴一散仙，银缾玉柄两翛然。\n茅山顶上携书簏，笠泽心中漾酒船。\n桐木布温吟倦後，桃花饭熟醉醒前。\n谢安四十余方起，犹自高闲得数年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}